    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue squares lived a peaceful life until the creature that feeds on them found them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue squares had to leave their caves and escape to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the red creature blocked their escape route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, our mission is to rescue our friends who remain underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our character gains various movement mechanics through the weapons they equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement mechanics are physics-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we explore the game world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we engage in various parkour challenges,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sweat in boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and obtain unique items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while trying to save our friends from the red creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever you click with the mouse, you will move in the opposite direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you press the right mouse button, you will perform your special attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain new abilities, you will progress to different areas.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue squares lived a peaceful life until the creature that feeds on them found them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue squares had to leave their caves and escape to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the red creature blocked their escape route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, our mission is to rescue our friends who remain underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our character gains various movement mechanics through the weapons they equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement mechanics are physics-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we explore the game world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we engage in various parkour challenges,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sweat in boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and obtain unique items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while trying to save our friends from the red creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever you click with the mouse, you will move in the opposite direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you press the right mouse button, you will perform your special attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain new abilities, you will progress to different areas.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "As you play HeHe, you'll carve your own path. You'll get lost in the hand-drawn HeHe universe. As you progress through the cave, you'll ask yourself &quot;Who am I?&quot; over and over again and sweat through various 2D platform challenges.",
